{"id":"22-teams","number":22,"slug":"agentic-engineering-in-teams","title":"Agentic engineering in teams","short":"Agentic engineering in teams","module":"Quality, safety, teams","summary":"Individuals can rewire their workflow overnight; teams can't. The teams that win with agents change how they work rather than sprinkling AI on top, share their know-how as skills and memory, keep humans accountable, and measure honestly: speed and quality together.","voice":"Eric","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"A solo developer can rebuild their workflow over a weekend. A team can't. And it's in teams, with shared code, reviews and production on-call, that agentic engineering gets genuinely hard.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 22","module":"Module 5 · Quality, safety, teams","title":"Agentic engineering in *teams*","subtitle":"Change the way you work, not just the tools.","bubble":"Team player, reporting in.","mood":"happy","human":true},"start":0.5,"dur":13.948,"words":[{"text":"A","s":0.8,"e":0.96},{"text":"solo","s":1,"e":1.28},{"text":"developer","s":1.36,"e":1.84},{"text":"can","s":1.92,"e":2.08},{"text":"rebuild","s":2.16,"e":2.56},{"text":"their","s":2.64,"e":2.72},{"text":"workflow","s":3,"e":3.28},{"text":"over","s":3.4,"e":3.52},{"text":"a","s":3.56,"e":3.6},{"text":"weekend.","s":3.68,"e":4.56},{"text":"A","s":4.64,"e":4.72},{"text":"team","s":4.92,"e":5.12},{"text":"can't.","s":5.36,"e":6.04},{"text":"And","s":6.32,"e":6.4},{"text":"it's","s":6.48,"e":6.6},{"text":"in","s":6.64,"e":6.8},{"text":"teams,","s":7.08,"e":7.44},{"text":"with","s":7.56,"e":7.68},{"text":"shared","s":7.84,"e":8},{"text":"code,","s":8.08,"e":8.56},{"text":"reviews","s":8.84,"e":9.12},{"text":"and","s":9.2,"e":9.36},{"text":"production","s":9.44,"e":9.84},{"text":"on-call,","s":9.92,"e":10.72},{"text":"that","s":10.8,"e":10.88},{"text":"agentic","s":11,"e":11.44},{"text":"engineering","s":11.72,"e":12},{"text":"gets","s":12.16,"e":12.32},{"text":"genuinely","s":12.4,"